& [CurrentShape] is inspected
  + public core procedure forms use strict serde and closed enum names
  + CLI request and response wrappers are private to one binary
  + query_sop MCP owns a separate manually assembled JSON Schema for ProtocolRequest
  + ProviderNeutralToolSchema lists semantic fields but is not a JSON Schema document
  + no shared schema crate, canonical normalization profile, schema digest, or conformance corpus exists for procedure tooling

& [Delineation] separates three gates
  + syntactic conformance asks whether a JSON value has the allowed structural form
  + semantic conformance asks whether identities, hashes, references, bounds, policies, and causal relationships are valid
  + authority admission asks whether a recognized principal permits the operation in the current generation
  + passing an earlier gate never implies a later gate

& [ArchitectureFinding] selects a reusable waist
  + private CLI forms must become transport-neutral public forms before schema or MCP projection
  + CLI, future MCP, provider tool definition, and conformance tests must import the same forms
  + canonical schema is provider-neutral Draft 2020-12; provider subsets are later projections

& [Disposition] is proceed_to_full_SJS_formation_only
